      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "YARRAMUNDI GO GO (1) finished in the money two on end before breaking through for an overdue win last start (19.46) at this track. Form here excellent including two wins. Drawn the fence and expected to go close. RIVERSIDE BEAST (4) ran a good time (19.96) when second a Grade 6 at Murray Bridge Straight after jumping from this box. Worth following up. MISS PIPER (2) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 0.8 lengths at Angle Park in a handy 19.87 beating Take The Hill. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from five starts. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. RIO LULU (6) put a gap on her rivals last start. Must be respected.",
